rs/sapk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sapk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sapk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sapk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sapk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sapk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sapk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/comments/526881975","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/issues/8030#issuecomment-526881975","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/8030","id":526881975,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyNjg4MTk3NQ==","user":{"login":"bwenrich","id":27692895,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NjkyODk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27692895?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich","html_url":"https://github.com/bwenrich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-01T03:11:21Z","updated_at":"2019-09-01T03:11:21Z","body":"If I understand correctly, the intention is to determine the size of the object that would be sent, so a client application could generate a progress-bar of the download progress.\r\n\r\nMy quick testing shows that Gitea didn't provide the \"Content-Length\" attribute in the HTTP response header, so the client does not know the response size in advance.\r\n\r\n```\r\n# Example from an arbitrary file on try.gitea.io\r\n$ curl --head https://try.gitea.io/gitea/gitea/src/branch/master/README.md\r\nHTTP/2 200\r\ncontent-type: text/html; charset=UTF-8\r\ndate: Sun, 01 Sep 2019 03:01:40 GMT\r\nset-cookie: lang=en-US; Path=/; Max-Age=2147483647\r\nset-cookie: i_like_gitea=<<removed>>; Path=/; HttpOnly\r\nset-cookie: _csrf=<<removed>>; Path=/; Expires=Mon, 02 Sep 2019 03:01:40 GMT; HttpOnly\r\nx-frame-options: SAMEORIGIN\r\n```\r\n```\r\n# Example from a generic Apache server\r\n$ curl --head https://domain.example.com/README.md\r\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\nDate: Sun, 01 Sep 2019 03:04:17 GMT\r\nLast-Modified: Sun, 18 Aug 2019 02:25:17 GMT\r\nAccept-Ranges: bytes\r\nContent-Length: 5934\r\ncontent-type: text/html; charset=UTF-8\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe Content-Length attribute is not mandatory for HTTP HEAD or HTTP GET, but could be useful in some cases.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/comments/526881975/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"bwenrich","id":27692895,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NjkyODk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27692895?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich","html_url":"https://github.com/bwenrich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwenrich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bw